: #00ae42; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>WS2812 RGB LEDs</strong><strong></strong></span><span style=\"color: #00ae42; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong></strong></span></a></span> to the LED output port of an expansion board. It enables independent control of multiple LEDs through the supported communication protocol. When used with multiple WS2812 LEDs, it delivers a variety of visual effects, making it suitable for models or applications that require multiple LED units.</p>\n<!--Specification-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\"><!--Banner-->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> </p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><!---图片链接替换----><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.eu/s8/default/99ac94188f2847fab5b1ef2c0a0eb06c/B-XA006_Banner.png\" height=\"386\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"1500\"/></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 120px; width: 111.864%;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; b